{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23235","headline":"题别遗爱草堂兼呈李十使君 · 白居易","name":"题别遗爱草堂兼呈李十使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾住炉峰下，书堂对药台。\n斩新萝径合，依旧竹窗开。\n砌水亲开决，池荷手自栽。\n五年方暂至，一宿又须回。\n纵未长归得，犹胜不到来。\n君家白鹿洞，闻道亦生苔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23235.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23235","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}